# Generated by paraglide on every compile.
#
# Formatting these achieves nothing — the next `paraglide-js compile` overwrites them
# unformatted — and it fails CI, where they are generated fresh rather than inherited from
# a working copy somebody happened to have run `prettier --write` over. Git ignores them
# for the same reason; this is prettier being told the same thing.
#
# settings.json and project_id are not listed: those are ours, hand-edited and tracked.
